    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Test Writer Harness (multi item)\n\nTest environments only. **Assert Test Environment** throws unless `FAO_ENV` is `test`, so this harness cannot write to a shared ledger.\n\n1. Sign in as the test invoker and start a run through `fao_run_start` (`p_invoked_via: test`)\n2. Claim it as n8n would (`fao_run_claim`)\n3. Writer with STARTED plus 7 ASSET_RECONCILED: must store 8 events, 7 asset rows\n4. Writer with a batch whose item 2 has no `policy_rationale`: must fail with the named Writer error, storing nothing\n5. Close the run through `fao_run_fail`\n\nEnvironment: `FAO_ENV`, `FAO_TEST_SUPABASE_URL`, `FAO_TEST_PUBLIC_KEY`, `FAO_TEST_INVOKER_EMAIL`, `FAO_TEST_INVOKER_PASSWORD`.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 5
      },
